# TR House Telvanni: "Books of Faith" (TR_m1_HT_Va2). Norahin Darys's "chores" adds "shipment of Temple propaganda"
# (10): the ship's captain Dunveri Rodran, on the Tel Ouada docks, is to dump a Temple book shipment. Paid 750 drakes
# ("Fine, here is the gold you desire." 3) he agrees (20); Norahin, told it cost 750 (Choice 2), repays 800 (100,
# +5 reputation).
# Position and PositionCell stand in for the travel; the AddItem for the gold a player has by now.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ht_mi2_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ht_va2_start
run
player->PositionCell 275 6977 13830 0 "Port Telvannis, Telvanni Council House: Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Norahin_Darys"->GetDistance player < 2500
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Norahin_Darys
ask chores
ask shipment of Temple propaganda
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Va2 == 10
bye
end

case ht_va2_dunveri
run
player->AddItem Gold_001 1000
player->Position 202425 151850 130 0
until 900 "TR_m1_Dunveri_Rodran"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m1_Dunveri_Rodran
ask shipment of Temple propaganda
choose 3
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Va2 == 20
bye
end

case ht_va2_done
run
player->PositionCell 275 6977 13830 0 "Port Telvannis, Telvanni Council House: Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Norahin_Darys"->GetDistance player < 2500
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Norahin_Darys
ask shipment of Temple propaganda
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Va2 == 100
bye
end
